  *  Inject arbitrary HTTP headers
  *  Terminate the HTTP request prematurely and smuggle raw data to non-HTTP services (Redis, Memcached, Elasticsearch)
The vulnerability exists because undici writes theÂ upgradeÂ value directly to the socket without validating for invalid header characters:

